WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.249
When your administrator allows it, the Active interaction panel shows Pause recording.

00:00:08.249 --> 00:00:12.749
Use it while the customer reads out card details, and click Resume recording

00:00:12.749 --> 00:00:14.340
as soon as they finish.

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:20.133
Collect data securely creates a one-time link for the customer to type their

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.532
card details on their own device.

00:00:22.532 --> 00:00:24.623
Only a masked value is kept.

00:00:24.623 --> 00:00:28.990
You, your supervisor and the recording never see the full number.

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.003
While a recording is paused, supervisors cannot listen in.

00:00:34.003 --> 00:00:38.000
Every pause and resume is recorded in the audit trail.

